  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "level": 0,
      "markdown": "Located in The Club at Paradise Point, An All-Hands Venue, The Wooden Nickel features a wide range of cuisines and drinks. We offer everything from classic burgers to the Nickel Special to exclusive Chef's Creation entrées. Everything is scratch-made using only the freshest and finest ingredients. **With a menu that changes every week, you will get the chance to sample a variety of offerings.**\n\nDining out isn't just about eating good food – it's also about having a great experience! You'll enjoy both at The Wooden Nickel! Whether you're enjoying a meal with your family or having a drink after work, you'll find the environment both comfortable and welcoming.\n\nAll hands welcome! We look forward to seeing you soon!\n\nCall us today for take-out 910-451-4882."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Stay up-to-date with our menu by joining our Facebook group",
      "level": 3,
      "markdown": "[Facebook group](https://www.facebook.com/groups/theclubatparadisepoint/)"
    }
